{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01801","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难二首 一 · 僧齐己","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行路难，君好看。\n惊波不在黤黮间，小人心里藏奔湍。\n七盘九折寒崷崪，翻车倒盖犹堪出。\n未似是非唇舌危，闇中潜毁平人骨。\n君不见楚灵均，千古沈冤湘水滨。\n又不见李太白，一朝却作江南客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}